      "comment": "FANTASTIC SPIKE (5) is an honest type in the frame at 45 of 109 starts including 40 wins, the latest scoring (29.64) over 530m at Murray Bridge. Form here sound including 19 wins. Looks the testing material here. AMRON TIGER (7) was in the minors two back (22.90) at Gawler but ran below best last time at this track, finishing 6th. Leading chance. CARE FACTOR (4) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten one length (30.85) behind Black Chip at this track. Will give a great sight again. DAKOTA SHINE (8) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
